# {{vulgar}} [[semen|Semen]].

A thickened oil product made from the excessive oils produced when a duck is cooked.  It doesn't spoil easily and was sometimes used by rural mid-wives as a lubricant to aid childbirth.  This is probably why it became slang for human sexual excretions.  There is a reference to its use, I believe, in a story by Erskine Caldwell.  It may have been William Faulkner. Perhaps someone else can find it and confirm the reference.

